{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/d641a152617b85842da26b6f0e4c18b28e133419ae5a7203879df73846332a26ffeacdfc506a64c4f1d4dcb5178c6772a6c192aee4b85a0be2191617e1d228b9","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/VDfVYxWYmwj4dm8DTWMXW8Z_IWWFSvtT5t6BfNtlxLEYFnOsnMxPR1thxPIhdSBX8qhWbDSS_KgovtWnsCQJKoVwWjCmLR78LsLj7dwiBAmNHTORFo4","width":600},"name":"Damon Seeley","title":"Senior Staff Designer, Material Design"},"document_id":4962851743334400,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p><strong><a href=\"https://relay.material.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Relay</a>&nbsp;Alpha 版正式发布</strong>——一套全新的工作流，让设计师与开发者之间快速、无缝地交接 Android UI 组件。</p>\n<p>想深入了解，请查看<a href=\"https://goo.gle/relay-ads-22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">我们来自 ADS 2022 的最新更新</a>，并从<a href=\"https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/1041056822461507786\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Relay for Figma 插件</a>开始上手。完整文档可在<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/jetpack/compose/tooling/relay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Android 开发者网站</a>查阅。</p>\n<h2>Relay 是什么？</h2>\n<p>Relay 让团队可以在 Figma 中设计 UI 组件，并直接在 Android 应用中使用它们。</p>\n<p>Relay 工作流由 Figma 和 Android Studio 两端的插件组成。设计师使用 Relay for Figma 插件为 UI 组件添加注解并打包，供开发者使用，其中包含布局、样式、动态内容和交互行为等信息。这些 UI Package 为 UI 组件提供了共享模型，可以在设计师与开发者的协作中交换和更新。</p>\n<p>开发者使用 Relay for Android Studio 插件导入 UI Package，并生成像素级精确的 Jetpack Compose 代码。这一过程可以即时实现布局和样式，并加速数据绑定，全程无需接触设计规格。UI Package 可以包含样式和主题，并引用已以代码形式存在的设计系统组件，同时保持与 Figma 的关联，以便快速更新组件。来自早期用户的反馈显示，团队首次完成 UI 实现的速度提升了 10 倍，后续迭代也更快。</p>\n<h2>参与进来</h2>\n<p>Relay 目前是一个 Alpha 产品，我们期待听到你和团队的反馈！希望你能加入采用 Relay 的设计师与开发者社区，分享<a href=\"https://goo.gle/relay-feedback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">反馈意见</a>，告诉我们如何让 Relay 变得更好。</p>\n<p>注册 <a href=\"https://goo.gle/relay-newsletter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Relay 邮件列表</a>以获取最新动态并与我们的团队保持联系——并请留意 11 月 2 日的<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MaterialDesign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">直播</a>，我们将深入剖析 Relay 的工作流。</p>","image":[],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2022","hero":{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/b5afe320429f7f6e0954a5d66b57db0f7455e4bc3c8975a7d97861895a7304830b45d98e164418e1824a1007946074c509f7b4404d91c5c2c226ab2e6c6d25a2","height":1016,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/QyoYgJkRYvwl5nPx8Nlg1b1aNjlaJyiyGhVJ988jvjY8jAEzeXkOhmx67JaRl-oR_hKA5hVUK5f5Aa-xOBumxs2_JaPX4uXBfr5jkK0L9hSgF5ITcw","width":2100}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":null,"meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"面向 Android UI 的全新设计转代码工作流","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/e85dce598f9cb435d658a8a3f31fc17594244a00196c5186febe91b066260e02368693156bd22f6d51f81ecd11b114b1d731d20f85f61c7a1d34f38ec36e2920","height":1016,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/hYo3y_50ujzy_xUUTieNrFV-E3bAbqaKoxk-JvBs261-Mj7EzSnEyx17YoIhWOA1_g_vS61m0-J1-1Ffo2nHq9mgMxICcqhKXWQq25YKSuyAxhRRE3Y","width":2100},"share_title":"Announcing Relay Alpha"},"published_date":"2022-10-24T09:00:00","slug":"relay-in-alpha","subtitle":"面向 Android UI 的全新设计转代码工作流","title":"Relay Alpha 正式发布","up_next":{"items":[{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/0d25dffc9e2881b87418fe29b89147843aa4d4a5bf78c2907308ce15c771e1c098f6018b3ed08e2281a1640ef436bb603fe4a548c0a184bbce23ae50974a4ca5","height":1200,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aZ6eUG4c4agdwbRku8bewmCoJqnhdy_d9LwiLbQlxLUc8r2Bm-yeW5Jbqg1nKpIFsibmnGjxL47MoKJbiMdzAnmEuJOijq-ADOPv4-z1fqXz7-OIyF4","width":2400},"link":{"aria_label":null,"href":"/blog/material-ads-2022","label":null,"open_new_window":false},"section":